        <style>/* Scope everything to the custom Home tab only */
.dept-custom-home-wrap * { box-sizing: border-box; }

.dept-custom-home-wrap{
  font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f4f6f9;
  color: #222;
  padding: 16px;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

/* Use your own wrapper in HTML, not Bootstrap .container */
.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-home{
  max-width: 1250px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 32px;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 8px;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
}

/* Typography */
.dept-custom-home-wrap h1{
  color: #7a0c0c;
  font-size: 32px;
  margin: 0 0 6px;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap h2{
  font-size: 23px;
  margin-top: 44px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  border-left: 6px solid #7a0c0c;
  padding-left: 12px;
  color: #333;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap h3{
  font-size: 18px;
  margin-top: 22px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  color: #0b3c5d;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap p{
  font-size: 15.8px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  text-align: justify;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap ul{
  margin: 0 0 14px 20px;
  font-size: 15.8px;
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap li{ margin-bottom: 6px; }

/* Hero */
.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-hero{
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc, #eef2f6);
  padding: 30px;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

/* HoD Section */
.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-hod-section{
  display: flex;
  gap: 28px;
  align-items: center;
  background: #f9fafb;
  padding: 26px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border-left: 6px solid #0b3c5d;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-hod-photo{
  width: 160px;
  height: 210px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 6px;
  border: 1px solid #ccc;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-hod-text{
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 280px;
}

/* Cards */
.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-card-grid{
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 22px;
  margin-top: 20px;
  justify-items: center;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-card{
  background: #f9fafb;
  padding: 22px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid #e2e5e9;
  max-width: 320px;
  width: 100%;
  text-align: center;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-card strong{
  display: block;
  font-size: 16.5px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  color: #0b3c5d;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-seat-number{
  font-size: 34px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #7a0c0c;
  margin: 6px 0;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

/* Highlight */
.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-highlight{
  background: #eef4ff;
  border-left: 6px solid #0b3c5d;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 15.8px;
}

/* Button */
.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-directions-btn{
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 10px;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  background: #0b3c5d;
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
}

.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-directions-btn:hover{
  background: #09324d;
}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 700px){
  .dept-custom-home-wrap h1{ font-size: 26px; }
  .dept-custom-home-wrap h2{ font-size: 21px; }
  .dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-home{ padding: 20px; }

  .dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-hod-section{
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-hod-text{
    text-align: justify;
  }
}



@media (max-width: 600px){
  .dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-directions-btn{
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
  }
}


/* --- Card text alignment fix --- */
.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-card{
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  text-align: center;
}

/* Seats per year label */
.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-card .seats-label{
  font-size: 13.5px;
  color: #555;
  margin-top: 6px;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
}

/* Improve number spacing */
.dept-custom-home-wrap .cse-seat-number{
  margin-top: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}</style>        
           <div class="dept-custom-home-wrap">
             <div class="cse-home">
<div class="cse-hero">
<h1>Department of Computer Science and Engineering</h1>
<p><strong>School of Engineering and Technology (earlier known as UIET)</strong><br />
Chhatrapati Shahu Ji Maharaj University, Kanpur</p>
<p>Driving innovation in computing through rigorous education, research, and high-performance technologies.</p>
</div>
<h2>About the Department</h2>
<p>The Department of Computer Science and Engineering is an important academic division in the School of Engineering and Technology at CSJM University, Kanpur. It provides a wide range of undergraduate, postgraduate, and doctoral courses that provide a solid theoretical base as well as practical skills and research orientation for students.</p>
<p>In addition, the academic environment of the department encourages students to develop analytical thought, to think ethically about their role as computer users and professionals, to be innovative and to engage in interdisciplinary studies. Furthermore, it seeks to encourage active interaction between students and faculty members with the industry and other research institutions, both nationally and internationally. In this context, the department aims to continually update and relate the content of its programs and activities to the relevant national education policies and international academic standards.</p>
<h2>Message from the Head of the Department</h2>
<div class="cse-hod-section">
<p><img class="cse-hod-photo" src="https://csjmu.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/sandesh_gupta.jpg" alt="Head of the Department" /></p>
<div class="cse-hod-text">
<p>Welcome to the Department of Computer Science &amp; Engineering. The CSE Department is focused upon developing a stimulating educational environment for our students that fosters their intellectual development, creative abilities and professional capabilities.</p>
<p>The department develops strong foundation in basic computer science while exposing students to cutting edge technologies like Artificial Intelligence (AI), High-Performance Computing (HPC) and Data-Driven Systems. We encourage our students to pursue Research-Oriented Learning, Competitive Programming, Innovation Activities and Interdisciplinary Projects.</p>
<p>The department aims at creating globally employable professionals through continued academic initiatives, modernization of physical infrastructure and mentorship by our faculty members so that our graduates can make meaningful contributions to industries, research organizations, and higher education institutions around the world.</p>
<p><strong>&#8211; Dr. Sandesh Gupta, Head, Department of Computer Science and Engineering</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
<h2>Academic Programs and Seat Intake</h2>
<div class="cse-card-grid">
<div class="cse-card">
<div class="cse-seat-number">B.Tech</div>
<p><strong>Computer Science and Engg.</strong></p>
<div class="cse-seat-number">180</div>
<div class="seats-label">seats per year</div>
</div>
<div class="cse-card">
<div class="cse-seat-number">B.Tech</div>
<p><strong>CSE &#8211; Artificial Intelligence</strong></p>
<div class="cse-seat-number">60</div>
<div class="seats-label">seats per year</div>
</div>
<div class="cse-card">
<div class="cse-seat-number">M.Tech</div>
<p><strong>Computer Science and Engg.</strong></p>
<div class="cse-seat-number">30</div>
<div class="seats-label">seats per year</div>
</div>
<div class="cse-card">
<div class="cse-seat-number">Ph.D.</div>
<p><strong>Computer Science and Engg.</strong></p>
<div class="seats-label">Full-time / Part-time<br />
as per university norms</div>
</div>
</div>
<h2>Supercomputing Hub for Artificial Intelligence</h2>
<p>The Department hosts a dedicated <strong>Supercomputing Hub for Artificial Intelligence</strong> that supports advanced computing, data-intensive research, and hands-on training in AI and high-performance computing.</p>
<div class="cse-card-grid">
<div class="cse-card">
<p><strong>Advanced AI Infrastructure</strong>GPU-accelerated systems equipped with NVIDIA H200-class processors for large-scale AI training, deep learning, and scientific computing.</p>
</div>
<div class="cse-card">
<p><strong>Academic &amp; Research Usage</strong>Supports computer vision, natural language processing, large language models, simulations, and interdisciplinary AI research.</p>
</div>
<div class="cse-card">
<p><strong>Capacity Building</strong>Enables undergraduate and postgraduate training, doctoral research, faculty development programs, and collaborative projects.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2>Competitive Programming &amp; ICPC</h2>
<div class="cse-highlight">The Department of Computer Science and Engineering is the host of the<br />
<strong>ICPC Asia Kanpur Regional Site</strong>, part of the International Collegiate Programming Contest (ICPC).<br />
The department has been hosting the ICPC Kanpur Regional <strong>continuously since 2017</strong>.</div>
<h2>Placements, Internships, and Higher Studies</h2>
<p>The department places strong emphasis on career readiness and higher education pathways.</p>
<ul>
<li>Graduates are placed in leading organizations including <strong>IBM, Microsoft, Google, MathWorks, Infosys, TCS</strong>.</li>
<li>Students pursue internships and project-based learning in software development, AI, data analytics, and system engineering.</li>
<li>Alumni progressed to higher studies at <strong>IITs, IISc, and reputed foreign universities</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Teaching and Research Areas</h2>
<ul>
<li>Programming, Data Structures, and Algorithms</li>
<li>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</li>
<li>Computer Vision and Image Processing</li>
<li>High-Performance Computing and AI Systems</li>
<li>Data Analytics and Decision Support Systems</li>
<li>Information Security and Emerging Technologies</li>
</ul>
<h2>Contact Information</h2>
<p><strong>Department of Computer Science and Engineering</strong><br />
School of Engineering and Technology<br />
CSJM University, Kanpur &#8211; 208024<br />
Email: <em>hod[dot]cse[at]csjmu[dot]ac[dot]in</em><br />
<a class="cse-directions-btn" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/1SJRWcgM43DNbQGg9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on Google Maps</a></p>
</div>
          </div>
        

      
    </div>
  </section>
